OL,3,GNEWSAPenny the peahen finds fame in her
OL,4,Anew home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sheffield suburb's residents have
OL,7,Fwelcomed an inquisitive peafowl into
OL,8,Ftheir community after the bird set up
OL,9,Fhome in local streets and gardens.
OL,11,FThe peahen was first spotted near
OL,12,FHillsborough Park in June, with the
OL,13,F"serial trespasser" regularly flying
OL,14,Fbetween the same few streets.
OL,16,FDubbed Penny by the locals, a Facebook
OL,17,Fpage reporting her antics through
OL,18,Fphotos and videos has more than 850
OL,19,Ffollowers.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
